# Executive offsites now live in the /offsite/ folder of this repo and are served directly.
# The old proxy to offsite.kuma.partners has been removed on purpose.
# Do not add a rule redirecting /offsite to /offsite/: Netlify treats both as the same
# path, so such a rule redirects to itself and causes ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS.

# Standalone offsite configurator for outbound links. Netlify already serves
# configurator.html for /offsite/configurator; this 200 rewrite also covers the
# trailing-slash form (Netlify matches rules with or without the slash). It is a
# rewrite to a file, never a redirect, so it cannot loop.
/offsite/configurator   /offsite/configurator.html   200
